"choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你拿起了已经微微泛黄的日记本，抚摸纸页时，指尖传来的触...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1621341004:1":{"key":"say:5:1621341004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1621341004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"与你成年后留下的研究资料不同，这时你的字迹还稍显稚嫩，...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1621341005:1":{"key":"say:6:1621341005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1621341005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"开头还在写计划表，下面已经在开小差，画那些稀奇古怪的、...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1621341006:1":{"key":"say:7:1621341006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1621341006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"抖一抖日记本，里面甚至掉出了一张……上课时背着老师偷偷...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:8:357:0":{"key":"document:8:357:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"刚刚不是坐在我同桌吗，怎么考试结果一公布，你就直接搬着书走了？\n……\n怎么不理我？真是因为考试成绩的事吗？\n……\n别摆出这么不爽的表情了，刚刚教授都以为你在给他翻白眼，差点骂你一顿。\n<style=\"highlight\">想多了。</style>\n第二的成绩也很好了，只是一道附加题没做对而已。\n<style=\"highlight\">闭嘴。</style>\n……\n<style=\"highlight\">那道附加题严重超纲，教授根本没教过星空魔法，你到底是怎么施展出来拿到满分的？</style>\n终于理人了？那是我课余时间自学的。你要是想学的话，下了课我们去天文台，我教你用这种魔法，怎么样？","textdes_id":"357","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"怎么换位置了？","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"6801860","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item14.png","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item14.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"true"},"document:9:358:0":{"key":"document:9:358:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"依照约定，和迪尔格雷一起拆解了星空魔法。跟别人一起研究魔法的感觉真好，能引发更多有趣的思考。\n刚刚的讨论给了我灵感，或许今天应该从那片星象开始观测，或许能再次捕捉到上古星象……\n（一段已经模糊不清的观测记录）\n迪尔格雷也加入了观测。可惜，他好像不太擅长星象观测，什么都没有看到。\n他的情绪有些低沉。或许下一次可以给他准备点惊喜？\n\n不愧是我最喜欢的法术，星雨术为夜空引来了一瞬盛大的流星雨，真是美丽的景象啊。\n可惜，计划只成功了一半。迪尔格雷一开始很兴奋，发现星雨术后就又黑脸了，还说我在用这种没用的法术戏弄他。\n哎，这可是我最擅长、最喜欢的魔法，怎么能说它没用呢？观测星空时看到流星雨是一种幸运的事，能够带给观星的人快乐。\n魔法存在的原因，不就是为人们带来快乐吗？往这个角度想想，能制造流星雨、为人们带来快乐与惊喜的星雨术，说不定才是伊索米亚最厉害的魔法呢。\n迪尔格雷对此嗤之以鼻。他坚持魔法的终极目标就是强大的力量，像星雨术这种只能观赏娱乐而没有实际用途的，只能算变戏法。\n算了，随他去吧。","textdes_id":"358","document_page_count":"2","document_title_cn":"观星日志（上页）","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"6801861","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item5.png","document_image_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item5.png","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item5.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"true"}},"speaker_entries":{"speaker:塔塔":{"key":"speaker:塔塔","source":"塔塔"},"speaker:旁白":{"key":"speaker:旁白","source":"旁白"}},"stats":{"source_node_count":11,"graph_node_count":9,"effect_event_count":0,"text_entry_count":8,"speaker_entry_count":2,"cast_state_line_count":6,"path_dependent_cast_state_count":0,"cinematic_count":0,"picture_count":0,"subtitle_count":0,"cinematic_dialogue_count":0}}